{'createTime': '2022-05-13T17:42:39.691Z', 'credits': [{'classification': {'createTime': '2020-10-06T16:20:21.847Z', 'id': '01EKZBDE6Q2R17QNTF7EZRETZG', 'title': '3D Model', 'updateTime': None}, 'collaborations': [], 'createTime': '2022-05-13T17:49:42.935Z', 'id': '01G2Z8MSMQVPZHV17WVZTQKJY2', 'organizations': [{'abbreviatedName': 'NASA', 'city': 'Washington', 'country': 'United States', 'createTime': '2020-10-06T16:20:19.264Z', 'fullName': 'National Aeronautics and Space Administration', 'id': '01EKZBDBP0AMWWXZWX5N8K15S8', 'stateProvinceCounty': 'D.C.', 'updateTime': None}, {'abbreviatedName': 'ESA', 'city': 'Paris', 'country': 'France', 'createTime': '2020-10-06T16:20:18.574Z', 'fullName': 'European Space Agency', 'id': '01EKZBDB0EP8Z1C74PK4456JYX', 'stateProvinceCounty': '', 'updateTime': None}, {'abbreviatedName': 'CSA', 'city': 'Longueuil', 'country': 'Canada', 'createTime': '2021-03-15T02:14:44.699Z', 'fullName': 'Canadian Space Agency', 'id': '01F0STM26VZW7WC1KCECA25Z68', 'stateProvinceCounty': 'Quebec', 'updateTime': None}], 'persons': [], 'updateTime': '2022-05-13T17:50:08.005Z'}], 'description': '<p>Use the downloadable STL files to print individual components of the Webb Space Telescope on a 3D printer. These components can be assembled to create a full, detailed 3D model of the telescope.</p>\n<p>Click here for a <a href="https://webbtelescope.org/contents/media/products/01G0MSRACZN6NDZTYHZJ44WWCY" target="_self">simplified version</a> that does not require assembly.&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>Printable Components</h3>\n<p>Each of the following 16 components is printed from a separate STL file.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Lower Portion of the Model</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Port (left) boom support for sunshield</li>\n<li>Starboard (right) boom support for sunshield</li>\n<li>Aft solar array extended</li>\n<li>Aft flap mechanism</li>\n<li>Aft shield cover portion after deployment</li>\n<li>Forward shield cover portion after deployment</li>\n<li>Lower Bus Mount  (Mount the other six components of the lower portion of the model to the Lower Bus Mount.)</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Sunshield Components</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Forward section of the sunshield with all five layers combined</li>\n<li>Aft section of the sunshield with all five layers combined</li>\n<li>Pin connecting the two sunshields parts together (Print <strong>four</strong> of these.)</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Upper Portion of the Model</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Primary mirror segments and instruments</li>\n<li>Arm with secondary mirror</li>\n<li>Starboard arm to secondary mirror</li>\n<li>Port arm to secondary mirror</li>\n<li>Mount connecting the primary mirror segments and instruments to the arm with the secondary mirror</li>\n<li>Mount connecting the port and starboard arms to the primary mirror segments and instruments</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Assembly note</h4>\n<p>We recommend assembling the model in the following order: 1) Lower portion; 2) Sunshield;  3) Upper portion. Once the three sections are complete, connect them together.</p>', 'downloadProducts': [{'asset': {'byteSize': 155884, 'id': '01G2ZGC3XJ31A395Z6WBVYKEEH', 'legacyURL': None, 'url': 'https://stsci-opo.org/STScI-01G2ZGC3XJ31A395Z6WBVYKEEH.stl'}, 'createTime': '2022-05-13T20:04:47.676Z', 'id': '01G2ZGC3XJ31A395Z6WBVYKEEH', 'linkPrefix': '1: Port boom', 'updateTime': '2022-05-31T19:01:05.709Z'}, {'asset': {'byteSize': 174684, 'id': '01G2ZGDKRDMBXXSKXD7B3BP71T', 'legacyURL': None, 'url': 'https://stsci-opo.org/STScI-01G2ZGDKRDMBXXSKXD7B3BP71T.stl'}, 'createTime': '2022-05-13T20:05:36.634Z', 'id': '01G2ZGDKRDMBXXSKXD7B3BP71T', 'linkPrefix': '2: Starboard boom', 'updateTime': '2022-05-31T19:01:09.302Z'}, {'asset': {'byteSize': 239384, 'id': '01G2ZGJP990DFQBVGFJGKQX1NH', 'legacyURL': None, 'url': 'https://stsci-opo.org/STScI-01G2ZGJP990DFQBVGFJGKQX1NH.stl'}, 'createTime': '2022-05-13T20:08:23.117Z', 'id': '01G2ZGJP990DFQBVGFJGKQX1NH', 'linkPrefix': '3: Solar array extended', 'updateTime': '2022-05-31T19:01:12.051Z'}, {'a